1
00:01:38,420 --> 00:01:46,420
And now, presenting Mokku, the rarest wooden puppet in the world, who moves freely without strings and even sings!

2
00:01:51,289 --> 00:01:55,060
First, Mokku will sing and walk!

3
00:01:57,520 --> 00:02:00,700
Come on, Mokku, sing. Sing!

4
00:02:01,040 --> 00:02:04,120
B-But I don't know any songs!

5
00:02:05,080 --> 00:02:07,220
Idiot, just make something up!

6
00:02:07,540 --> 00:02:13,660
But I... You bastard, you know what'll happen if you don't sing.

7
00:02:20,225 --> 00:02:22,320
Come on! That's it, go!

8
00:02:55,060 --> 00:02:59,660
Tears fall when you're sad

9
00:03:01,700 --> 00:03:04,040
I'm just a sad

10
00:03:05,070 --> 00:03:06,660
Wooden puppet

11
00:03:08,940 --> 00:03:10,600
Wooden puppet

12
00:03:16,680 --> 00:03:25,320
And now, ladies and gentlemen, next up is a delightful puppet dance, the polka!

13
00:03:27,420 --> 00:03:28,620
Hey, dance!

14
00:03:28,799 --> 00:03:36,440
But... I-I can't dance... Idiot! Just dance however you want!

15
00:03:36,840 --> 00:03:38,400
Uh...

16
00:03:42,160 --> 00:03:43,160
There!

17
00:03:59,530 --> 00:04:03,520
I'll take some tea.

18
00:04:36,320 --> 00:04:37,320
(Laughter)

19
00:05:02,220 --> 00:05:07,620
A new video anime has come out. I explained about the animation unit, but this really rakes in the cash!

20
00:05:17,840 --> 00:05:18,840
Mokku...

21
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:23,620
I feel bad for him, but he's about to go through something way worse.

22
00:05:23,920 --> 00:05:29,840
That's right. We puppets are just playthings for humans.

23
00:05:30,710 --> 00:05:34,800
They work you to the bone, and in the end, they throw you into the fire.

24
00:05:35,050 --> 00:05:41,380
No matter how terribly we're treated, it can't be helped. We've been puppets from the day we were made.

25
00:05:47,700 --> 00:05:49,800
Grandpa...

26
00:06:06,500 --> 00:06:10,200
[[NO AUDIO]]

27
00:06:25,670 --> 00:06:32,480
Mokku, where did you go? I'm all alone again...

28
00:06:34,015 --> 00:06:37,200
Please come home, my Mokku.

29
00:06:42,150 --> 00:06:44,080
I'm sorry, Grandpa.

30
00:06:45,540 --> 00:06:53,540
Have you come to your senses yet, Mokku? Didn't I tell you back at the junk shop? Grandpa is the one you should feel sorry for, not yourself.

31
00:06:55,360 --> 00:07:01,340
Grandpa's so worried about you he can't sleep. He even sold his coat and caught a cold.

32
00:07:02,000 --> 00:07:04,360
And forgetting his kindness makes you an awful guy, Mokku.

33
00:07:06,200 --> 00:07:07,780
Oh? Did that make you mad, Mokku?

34
00:07:09,190 --> 00:07:11,040
I'm going to work for Grandpa.

35
00:07:11,580 --> 00:07:14,140
Well, I'll be. Where on earth?

36
00:07:14,570 --> 00:07:17,400
I'll work here and buy Grandpa an overcoat before I go home.

37
00:07:18,000 --> 00:07:21,380
Hahaha! That's why you're so naive.

38
00:07:23,490 --> 00:07:26,660
The world doesn't work that easily. You'd better give up.

39
00:07:27,435 --> 00:07:29,840
Hmph. I've had enough of your meddling.

40
00:07:30,630 --> 00:07:36,200
Take my advice, Mokku. If you trust humans too much, you'll make a fool of yourself. Hey, Mokku!

41
00:07:36,940 --> 00:07:37,940
Shut up!

42
00:07:38,910 --> 00:07:39,920
He's gone...

43
00:07:41,580 --> 00:07:43,840
Whatever. Good riddance to that annoying pest...

44
00:07:46,875 --> 00:07:48,700
Well, if it isn't Mokku!

45
00:07:51,250 --> 00:07:52,250
Um... Oyakata?

46
00:07:52,940 --> 00:07:53,940
What!

47
00:07:54,530 --> 00:07:57,840
Starting tomorrow, I'm going to work as hard as I can for you, Oyakata!

48
00:07:58,400 --> 00:08:05,960
Well, that's an admirable attitude. If you're going to be cooperative, it'll save me the trouble of yelling at you.

49
00:08:09,420 --> 00:08:10,780
In return, though...

50
00:08:11,380 --> 00:08:12,380
What?

51
00:08:14,515 --> 00:08:17,420
I want you to give me a share of what I earn.

52
00:08:18,174 --> 00:08:19,174
What?!

53
00:08:20,745 --> 00:08:21,745
Give it back!

54
00:08:24,825 --> 00:08:26,220
You little...

55
00:08:35,919 --> 00:08:36,919
[[NO AUDIO]]

56
00:08:44,580 --> 00:08:47,720
I see! Hahahahahaha!

57
00:08:48,459 --> 00:08:55,840
If you're gonna become more popular and work hard, I've got no complaints. Fine, I'll give you a cut.

58
00:08:57,409 --> 00:09:04,820
Thank you, Oyakata! I'll do my best. / Good, good boy. I'll give you plenty, so go on to sleep now.

59
00:09:05,200 --> 00:09:06,200
Okay.

60
00:09:09,434 --> 00:09:11,160
Stupid puppet.

61
00:09:28,769 --> 00:09:30,180
I'm coming right back!

62
00:09:30,360 --> 00:09:32,280
Coming back!

63
00:09:34,059 --> 00:09:35,059
Coming back!

64
00:09:35,600 --> 00:09:36,600
Ta-da!

65
00:10:06,360 --> 00:10:07,360
[[APPLAUSE]]

66
00:10:16,060 --> 00:10:17,060
[[LAUGHTER]]

67
00:10:18,555 --> 00:10:21,020
I'm making a fortune here!

68
00:10:21,060 --> 00:10:22,060
Um, Boss!

69
00:10:24,859 --> 00:10:26,480
Got something to say?

70
00:10:26,840 --> 00:10:31,880
About my promised share... I'm worried about Grandpa, so please let me go home.

71
00:10:32,675 --> 00:10:35,160
What?! You idiot!

72
00:10:36,109 --> 00:10:39,340
You think you can leave after earning this measly bit?

73
00:10:40,000 --> 00:10:44,000
But you promised... / Shut up!

74
00:10:44,565 --> 00:10:45,565
Ah!

75
00:10:49,860 --> 00:10:50,860
Hey!

76
00:10:51,789 --> 00:10:54,260
I never intended to give you a single penny from the start!

77
00:10:54,615 --> 00:10:56,860
You'll work until you break into pieces!

78
00:10:57,275 --> 00:10:59,220
Understand, you fool?!

79
00:11:00,019 --> 00:11:01,260
(coughing)

80
00:11:09,159 --> 00:11:14,380
Poor Mokku. In the end, we puppets are just playthings for humans.

81
00:11:16,439 --> 00:11:17,439
(coughing)

82
00:11:35,339 --> 00:11:37,880
Grandpa...

83
00:11:38,659 --> 00:11:42,740
Mokku, just give up. We're puppets.

84
00:11:43,820 --> 00:11:48,900
Humans work us to the bone, and once we break, they burn us. That's the end of it.

85
00:11:50,005 --> 00:11:53,360
The Cricket was right. I was wrong.

86
00:11:54,609 --> 00:11:55,609
Ah...

87
00:12:13,699 --> 00:12:16,960
I worked for that money. It's mine.

88
00:12:17,585 --> 00:12:21,120
If I take it home, I can buy Grandpa an overcoat and anything else he needs.

89
00:12:22,029 --> 00:12:25,420
Like hell I'll let that monster of a boss keep it all to himself!

90
00:12:25,835 --> 00:12:26,880
All right.

91
00:12:36,530 --> 00:12:38,000
Mokku, what are you going to do?

92
00:12:39,075 --> 00:12:40,660
I'm going to avenge everyone.

93
00:12:41,605 --> 00:12:45,500
Stop it, Mokku. Don't you know how terrifying Oyakata is?

94
00:12:46,250 --> 00:12:48,760
He'll smash you to pieces and throw you into the stove!

95
00:12:49,250 --> 00:12:50,250
Don't do it, Mokku.

96
00:13:04,385 --> 00:13:05,385
(chirping)

97
00:13:05,700 --> 00:13:07,820
I stole the key to get outside...

98
00:13:12,280 --> 00:13:13,280
(chirping)

99
00:13:13,820 --> 00:13:14,260
(chirping)

100
00:13:14,261 --> 00:13:15,480
Good night.

101
00:14:17,399 --> 00:14:19,260
(coughing)

102
00:14:22,260 --> 00:14:23,260
(weeping)

103
00:14:26,880 --> 00:14:28,280
(weeping)

104
00:14:31,049 --> 00:14:32,049
(snoring)

105
00:14:47,199 --> 00:14:50,600
Look, it worked. Mokku, run while you have the chance. Come on, hurry!

106
00:14:50,740 --> 00:14:52,560
Let's all escape together!

107
00:14:53,675 --> 00:14:57,060
We can't. We can't walk on our own like you, Mokku.

108
00:14:57,405 --> 00:14:59,320
Don't worry about us. Get out of here, quick!

109
00:14:59,585 --> 00:15:00,585
No!

110
00:15:02,260 --> 00:15:03,260
All right.

111
00:15:04,430 --> 00:15:06,680
There's no way I'm leaving you in a terrifying place like this!

112
00:15:17,620 --> 00:15:25,620
(noise)

113
00:15:29,680 --> 00:15:30,160
Whoa!

114
00:15:30,600 --> 00:15:32,820
Huh?! What? Mokku!

115
00:15:34,839 --> 00:15:38,340
That bastard's trying to run off after stealing my money?!

116
00:15:39,620 --> 00:15:40,620
Wait!!

117
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:43,880
Wait, hold on!

118
00:15:46,099 --> 00:15:49,960
You little... No! I worked hard for this money!

119
00:15:54,559 --> 00:15:55,559
Now!

120
00:16:02,099 --> 00:16:04,020
Like hell I'll let you get away!

121
00:16:14,660 --> 00:16:16,220
Hahaha!

122
00:16:17,929 --> 00:16:24,480
Hold it right there!

123
00:16:25,040 --> 00:16:29,341
You thought you could get away from me?!

124
00:16:41,650 --> 00:16:43,900
Don't worry about us, just run!

125
00:16:43,910 --> 00:16:45,520
Hurry, run away on your own!

126
00:16:47,855 --> 00:16:50,020
Mokku, don't worry about us!

127
00:16:56,505 --> 00:16:57,505
Mokku!

128
00:16:59,040 --> 00:17:00,040
Mokku!

129
00:17:04,560 --> 00:17:05,339
Grrr...

130
00:17:05,340 --> 00:17:06,641
Aaaargh!

131
00:17:08,809 --> 00:17:10,440
Hold it, damn it!

132
00:17:16,799 --> 00:17:18,400
I'm sorry we ran away!

133
00:17:19,199 --> 00:17:21,440
Hey, get back here!

134
00:17:21,805 --> 00:17:22,805
Ah, he's coming!

135
00:17:25,839 --> 00:17:29,060
Wait! Wait, wait, wait, hold on!

136
00:18:00,040 --> 00:18:01,060
Aaah!

137
00:18:01,280 --> 00:18:06,820
Aaah! Help me!

138
00:18:07,620 --> 00:18:10,660
Aaah! Aaah!

139
00:18:20,720 --> 00:18:21,720
(Screams)

140
00:18:27,674 --> 00:18:31,240
Why do I have to suffer like this?

141
00:18:32,894 --> 00:18:34,880
Because I'm a puppet...

142
00:18:35,129 --> 00:18:39,880
I hate this... Being a puppet... I want to become human.

143
00:18:42,309 --> 00:18:43,660
I want to become human!

144
00:19:11,799 --> 00:19:16,940
Mokku, I am the Fairy of the Oak Tree, your birthplace.

145
00:19:17,154 --> 00:19:21,040
Oh, then you're the one who brought me to life!

146
00:19:25,849 --> 00:19:29,540
I don't want to be a puppet anymore. I want to become human!

147
00:19:30,119 --> 00:19:32,360
I do not possess that power.

148
00:19:32,999 --> 00:19:35,260
What? Then I can never become human?

149
00:19:36,060 --> 00:19:37,060
You can.

150
00:19:39,354 --> 00:19:42,980
Mokku, becoming human is entirely up to you.

151
00:19:43,589 --> 00:19:46,560
What should I do? Please, tell me!

152
00:19:47,144 --> 00:19:54,600
Always be a good boy. If you have a righteous and kind heart, you will surely become human.

153
00:19:55,020 --> 00:19:56,020
Really?

154
00:19:56,479 --> 00:20:03,200
It is true. You must always strive to have a good and kind heart.

155
00:20:03,449 --> 00:20:09,380
I'll try my best to have a good, kind heart. And I'll definitely become human.

156
00:20:09,965 --> 00:20:13,940
I'll be looking forward to that day, Mokku.

157
00:20:18,899 --> 00:20:20,760
Goodbye, Mokku.

158
00:20:33,689 --> 00:20:36,480
A good heart, a kind heart...

159
00:20:42,309 --> 00:20:47,340
Mokku, won't you ever come back home to me?

160
00:20:47,894 --> 00:20:51,720
I could never make another you again.

161
00:20:58,120 --> 00:20:59,660
Was I just hearing things?

162
00:21:08,879 --> 00:21:10,120
(Grandpa!)

163
00:21:11,989 --> 00:21:14,520
(Grandpa!)

164
00:21:18,200 --> 00:21:19,360
Mokku!

165
00:21:24,524 --> 00:21:25,524
Mokku!

166
00:21:28,299 --> 00:21:29,299
(Grandpa!)

167
00:21:30,960 --> 00:21:31,360
Grandpa!

168
00:21:31,440 --> 00:21:32,440
Mokku!

169
00:21:35,089 --> 00:21:36,089
Grandpa!

170
00:21:37,995 --> 00:21:39,020
Mokku!

171
00:21:46,460 --> 00:21:47,280
Grandpa!

172
00:21:47,460 --> 00:21:48,460
Mokku!

173
00:21:49,040 --> 00:21:55,080
Grandpa, I'm sorry. I'll be a good boy. I'll become human. I'll go to school, too.

174
00:21:55,620 --> 00:21:58,180
Mokku... Mokku...

175
00:21:59,840 --> 00:22:05,120
[[NO AUDIO]]

176
00:22:12,849 --> 00:22:14,560
- I'm off! - Alright.

177
00:22:15,349 --> 00:22:17,000
Grandpa, I'm heading out!

178
00:22:18,299 --> 00:22:21,020
- Take care. - Okay!

179
00:22:22,939 --> 00:22:24,720
Go straight to school, now.

180
00:22:24,869 --> 00:22:27,620
Ah, ha, ha, ugh...

181
00:22:40,739 --> 00:22:46,760
You're called Mokku, aren't you?

182
00:22:49,099 --> 00:22:51,260
I know a really fun place.

183
00:22:51,424 --> 00:22:52,540
Really?

184
00:22:52,541 --> 00:22:54,460
Come on, let's go together!

185
00:22:56,580 --> 00:22:59,440
Mokku, it's such a wonderful place.

186
00:22:59,554 --> 00:23:00,554
Hmph! No way!

187
00:23:15,229 --> 00:23:16,229
(Music)

188
00:23:18,960 --> 00:23:26,960
Okay! Wait for me!

189
00:23:33,679 --> 00:23:36,340
Mokku and Grandfather lived very happily together.

190
00:23:37,099 --> 00:23:44,320
However, because Grandfather doted only on Mokku, Redbeard the mouse, who had lived there first, grew jealous.

191
00:23:45,839 --> 00:23:50,420
Scheming with Kenken the fox and his gang, Redbeard pushes Mokku into the river.

192
00:23:51,560 --> 00:23:56,640
After swallowing so much freezing river water, will Mokku be able to revive?

193
00:23:57,429 --> 00:24:00,840
Look forward to next week's Kashi no Ki Mokku!

